## Welcome to Comfy with ComfyUI

I made this site not just to share workflows, but to show what generative AI can do, and how ComfyUI itself works and what it's capable of.

Templates will get a model running, but to build on that the way you want, you really do need to know the basics.

I think it can also be a good place for experienced users to keep up with how ComfyUI is evolving.
